From 400fa8cc95ad1b56eba7f10afed3a1e7b4ac263f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pogo-bash <pogo-bash@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:55:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] LibWeb: WebGL contexts carry alpha and premultipliedAlpha to
 the executor; DEPTH_STENCIL to a WebGL executor as it is

A WebGL implementation as the executor made every drawing buffer RGBA and premultiplied: alpha: false contexts
reported ALPHA_BITS 8, kept the clear's alpha and blended against it. The two attributes go with depth, stencil and
antialias through the transport (and the Compositor IPC, where they are carried and not yet used). A WebGL 1
executor refuses DEPTH24_STENCIL8 renderbuffers, so DEPTH_STENCIL is passed as it is.
---
 Libraries/LibWeb/Compositor/CompositorConnection.cpp | 4 ++--
 Libraries/LibWeb/Compositor/CompositorConnection.h   | 2 +-
 Libraries/LibWeb/Compositor/CompositorHost.cpp       | 4 ++--
 Libraries/LibWeb/WebGL/RemoteWebGLTransport.h        | 2 +-
 Libraries/LibWeb/WebGL/WebGLRenderingContext.cpp     | 4 +++-
 Libraries/LibWeb/WebGL/WebGLRenderingContextImpl.cpp | 4 +++-
 Services/Compositor/CanvasHost.cpp                   | 4 ++--
 Services/Compositor/CanvasHost.h                     | 2 +-
 Services/Compositor/CompositorWebContentServer.ipc   | 2 +-
 Services/Compositor/ConnectionFromWebContent.cpp     | 4 ++--
 Services/Compositor/ConnectionFromWebContent.h       | 2 +-
 Services/Compositor/OpenGLContext.h                  | 5 +++++
 12 files changed, 24 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Libraries/LibWeb/Compositor/CompositorConnection.cpp b/Libraries/LibWeb/Compositor/CompositorConnection.cpp
